@startuml UC8_View_Hourly_Forecast_Activity_Diagram

title UC8: View Hourly Forecast - Activity Diagram

start
:User selects "Hourly Forecast" option;
:System retrieves hourly forecast data for next 3 hours;

if (Complete data available?) then (yes)
  :System displays forecast for each hour;
  :System shows which service(s) provided the data;
else (partial)
  :System displays available data with gaps indicated;
endif

if (User wants to rate?) then (yes)
  :User rates individual forecasts (UC10);
endif

stop

@enduml
